        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions GNT625SMTSBR, Elegant Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Door Pull is available in 8 inch, 10 inch, and 12 inch lengths. Choose from a wide selection of finishes including oil rubbed bronze and satin brass. This pull is perfect for use all over the house. Not too large, the 5/8 inch diameter means that it will look stunning as a cabinet door pull or even as a dresser drawer handle. The Elegant Garnet 4 Door Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions Garnet Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GNT04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262220\"><b>First Impressions GNT625SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>GNT625008SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>GNT625010SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>GNT625012SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Smooth Door Pull",
                "description": "The Traditional Door Pull is available in 8 inch, 10 inch, and 12 inch lengths. Choose from a wide selection of finishes including oil rubbed bronze and satin brass. This pull is perfect for use all over the house. Not too large, the 5/8 inch diameter means that it will look stunning as a cabinet door pull or even as a dresser drawer handle. The Elegant Garnet 4 Door Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.",
